# Toolchain versions for asdf / mise / rtx.
#
# Run `asdf install` (or `mise install`) in this directory to materialise
# everything listed below. The format is `<plugin> <version>` per line.
#
# This project builds a Supabase/Deno backend, a SvelteKit web app and a
# Flutter mobile app, so nodejs, deno and flutter are all live here. The
# flutter pin matches ci.yml's FLUTTER_VERSION — bump them together, or CI
# and a laptop stop agreeing. Pinning a version here is a stronger
# guarantee than `engines` in package.json or `requires-python` in
# pyproject.toml because asdf shims the binary itself.

